    "detailed_description": "Strap in for Caddywack! Dive into a high-octane blend of arcade-style driving and inventive platforming in this physics-based puzzle game that's all about precision and speed. Navigate through thrilling levels where each stage presents a new passenger and a challenging route packed with obstacles.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExciting Physics-Based Gameplay: Experience the rush of managing your car's momentum, mastering jumps, and overcoming physics-based puzzles to reach your destination.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRace Against Time: Every level challenges you to deliver passengers to their destinations before time runs out. Can you beat the clock?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJoin the Caddywack community and put your reflexes to the ultimate test. Can you ensure every passenger reaches their destination in time?",
